{"seq":25,"t":"2026-11-12T04:42:17.621Z","dir":"out","ok":true,"cmd":"mg","result":{"id":"phone-chat","type":"PhoneChatMinigame","title":"Your Phone","isActive":true,"available":true,"returnsToContainer":false,"isComplete":false,"result":null,"text":"×\n85%\n←\nAgent HaX\nThat noise is a cross-cut shredder. It's been running since before you landed.\n04:45\nShutter's his round. The office door's quieter.\n04:45\nNight guard. Twenty-four. Not ours, not theirs. Don't hurt him.\n04:45\nQuintero's going to hate that she was right if this goes badly. Let's not.\n04:45\nThe office door. I'll pick it.\n04:45\nGood. It's the west door. That's the front desk, and nowhere near his torch.\n04:45\nWho else is inside?\n04:45\nMargaret Sorensen runs the place. County clerk for twenty years before this.\n04:45\nA clerk's on tonight, and an IT contractor, Jesse Tran. Viral Dynamics' staff files have a Tran in them.\n04:45\nOnce you're in, set the laptop up in the reading room and get me into their catalogue. It's how we find out what Sorensen's burning.\n04:45\nOn my way.\n04:45\nFirst box is in. There's a list to go with it. Open this.\n04:46\nI've a field guide for the ledger, if you want it. Ask me.\n04:46\n1. The catalogue. What am I looking for?\n2. Tran.\n3. I need a field guide.\n4. Where do I stand?\n5. That's all for now.\n▼ more choices\n Add to Notepad\nClose","controls":[{"index":0,"label":"×","id":"minigame-close","classes":"minigame-close-button","disabled":false},{"index":1,"label":"←","id":"back-button","classes":"back-button","disabled":false},{"index":2,"label":"1. The catalogue. What am I looking for?","id":null,"classes":"choice-button","disabled":false},{"index":3,"label":"2. Tran.","id":null,"classes":"choice-button","disabled":false},{"index":4,"label":"3. I need a field guide.","id":null,"classes":"choice-button","disabled":false},{"index":5,"label":"4. Where do I stand?","id":null,"classes":"choice-button","disabled":false},{"index":6,"label":"5. That's all for now.","id":null,"classes":"choice-button","disabled":false},{"index":7,"label":"Add to Notepad","id":"minigame-notebook","classes":"minigame-button","disabled":false},{"index":8,"label":"Close","id":"minigame-cancel","classes":"minigame-button","disabled":false}],"fields":[],"npcId":"agent_0x99","phoneId":"player_phone","contacts":[],"awaitingContactSelection":false,"conversationActive":true,"dialogue":{"npcId":"agent_0x99","text":"","choices":[{"number":1,"index":0,"text":"The catalogue. What am I looking for?"},{"number":2,"index":1,"text":"Tran."},{"number":3,"index":2,"text":"I need a field guide."},{"number":4,"index":3,"text":"Where do I stand?"},{"number":5,"index":4,"text":"That's all for now."}],"awaitingChoice":true,"ended":false},"se":{"characterId":null,"bar":null,"tells":[],"band":0}}}
